# Cutting-edge Applications and Challenges of Digital Media Art in Landscape Design

**Authors:** Zimeng Wang, Yingjie Chen

## Abstract
<jats:p>In today's rapid development of science and technology, digital media art is gradually penetrating into all aspects of landscape 
design. The combination of the two not only provides unprecedented opportunities for landscape design innovation, but also poses new challenges to it. With the booming development of digital media art, digital media art has gone from VR to AR, from projection mapping to light 
show to interactive installation art, which brings more possibilities for landscape design and enriches people s vision and senses, so it is necessary to study the cutting-edge applications and challenges of digital media art in landscape design.</jats:p>

**Source:** https://doi.org/10.18686/rcha.v2i5.4542

